@title Machine options: Cabinet and Commissioning follow the choice
@area Options
# The fixture's Cooling fan (-Q9, -M9) is only with the Cooling fan option. With the fan off the Cabinet plate keeps the
# fan's spot but veils it (hover says why) and the heat leaves it out; Commissioning does not list its checks.
open qa/fixtures/machine-options.novo
wait 20
click_text Cabinet #1
wait 20
shot cabinet-fan-off
check_layout
move 640 370
wait 3
move 642 372
wait 8
shot cabinet-fan-off-hover
click_text Commissioning #1
wait 20
expect "0 / 76"
shot commissioning-fan-off
check_layout
key ctrl+k
wait 3
text option fan on
wait 4
key Enter
wait 10
expect "0 / 86"
shot commissioning-fan-on
check_layout
click_text Cabinet #1
wait 20
shot cabinet-fan-on
check_layout
